      "label": "girls enjoying themselves in shallow ocean water",
      "description": "Two young Black girls are smiling and floating in shallow ocean water near the shore. They are the central focus of the scene, positioned side by side in the water, with waves gently breaking around them. The scene conveys a sense of joy and playfulness, contrasted with the misleading text overlay that falsely claims they are 'underwater diving.'",
